Z||000005||Huck||02-26-2001||09:32 PM||||My dinger had some serious problems after I installed my footwell subwoofer a couple years ago.  I shoved the box into place (good ol friction fit!) and after that the ding was a much lower pitch, and slower.  Also, it would come on by itself just driving down the road..  A bit annoying at first, but I got used to it and explained to others that my car had a personality.....<P>Dont trash talk my car or it'll tell you where to go!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
